### 2. Comprehensive Stale Cache Purging & Mutation Integrity
#### [MODIFY] [convex/predictor.ts](file:///c:/Users/OMALE%20DANJUMA%20OGALE/Downloads/SELECTION%20SCREENER/Sports-Screener/convex/predictor.ts)
- Upgrade `purgeOld` mutation from only deleting `predictorDays` to a **cascading purge** that locates and removes:
  - Stale `predictorDays` (`dayKey < cutoff`).
  - Stale `predictorMatches` (`dayKey < cutoff`).
  - Stale `predictorVerdicts` (`dayKey < cutoff`).
  - Stale `aiPredictorStats` (`dayKey < cutoff`).
- Ensure `replaceMatches` cleans up stale verdicts when refreshing a day's fixtures so no orphaned or mismatched verdicts persist.

